// delay had eased back down in between, so the next one ran the buffer dry and every body jumped forward together. Only the network's
// lateness is held: a sender's own pause never enters it. And only a stall the delay can cover (≤ 350 ms: 50 + 350 = the 400 ms cap): a one-off
